    "detailed_description": "The heroine falls into a maze for some strange reason.<br />\r\nYou will operate the heroine to survive in this maze for 30 days before you have a chance to escape.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDuring the day, you can go into the maze to collect the supplies you need to survive.<br />\r\nBut you have to get back to the main base before dark!<br />\r\nThe maze at night is unpredictable, and there will be scary monsters.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn the maze, you may experience several different, fairy-tale worlds.<br />\r\nThere are many countries in this fairy world, such as the kingdom of playing cards, baboon country, steam country and so on.<br />\r\nNations are at war with each other and the world is on the verge of collapse...<br />\r\nAs the number of days you live increases, you will be able to travel to every country and discover the secrets hidden in every corner of the world.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn order to survive, you can build some weapons or defensive towers to ward off monsters.<br />\r\nHowever, I recommend building some traps.<br />\r\nTraps cooperate with each other, can form a platoon to contain monsters, causing higher damage.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a 2D style, survival and tower defense built survival game.<br />\r\nCombine dungeon and tower defense construction, become a trap master, and punch unexpected Combo.",
    "about_the_game": "The heroine falls into a maze for some strange reason.<br />\r\nYou will operate the heroine to survive in this maze for 30 days before you have a chance to escape.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDuring the day, you can go into the maze to collect the supplies you need to survive.<br />\r\nBut you have to get back to the main base before dark!<br />\r\nThe maze at night is unpredictable, and there will be scary monsters.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn the maze, you may experience several different, fairy-tale worlds.<br />\r\nThere are many countries in this fairy world, such as the kingdom of playing cards, baboon country, steam country and so on.<br />\r\nNations are at war with each other and the world is on the verge of collapse...<br />\r\nAs the number of days you live increases, you will be able to travel to every country and discover the secrets hidden in every corner of the world.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn order to survive, you can build some weapons or defensive towers to ward off monsters.<br />\r\nHowever, I recommend building some traps.<br />\r\nTraps cooperate with each other, can form a platoon to contain monsters, causing higher damage.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a 2D style, survival and tower defense built survival game.<br />\r\nCombine dungeon and tower defense construction, become a trap master, and punch unexpected Combo.",
    "short_description": "This is a 2D style, survival and tower defense built survival game. Combine dungeon and tower defense construction, become a trap master, and punch unexpected Combo. The more days you survive, you will have the opportunity to travel through a complete fairy tale world.",
